e0$. At the identity, the plus fundamental field of this bracket has value $\left. rac d{dt}ight|_0\exp(t(E_{00}-E_{11}))=E_{00}-E_{11}
e0$. Hence step 1.1 yields $[\widehat X_M,\widehat Y_M]=-\widehat{[X,Y]}_M
e\widehat{[X,Y]}_M$, so the claimed homomorphism identity fails.
